                                "sense_id": "17d52ce2-0bc3-33b6-98b4-ec417fc5d663",
                                "text": "But the Hindus turned out and broke their heads; when, finding lawlessness pleasant, Hindus and Muhammadans together raised an aimless sort of Donnybrook just to see how far they could go."
